CS-WebUI is an independent .NET binding for WebUI.

Bundled native assets are source builds of the reviewed
Runic-Artifex/webui revision recorded in eng/webui-source-build-provenance.json.
WebUI is Copyright (c) 2020-2026 Hassan Draga and contributors,
distributed under the MIT License:
https://github.com/webui-dev/webui

The managed bridge implementation is informed by WebUI's wire protocol and
MIT-licensed TypeScript bridge. The complete upstream license is retained in this repository at
eng/licenses/WebUI-LICENSE.txt and in the CsWebUi.Native package under
licenses/WebUI/.

The WebUI and C# logo is the official webui_csharp.png asset published by
webui-dev/webui-logo, Copyright (c) 2023 Hassan Draga, distributed under the
MIT License:
https://github.com/webui-dev/webui-logo

The logo license is retained at eng/licenses/WebUI-Logo-LICENSE.txt and in the
NuGet packages under licenses/WebUI-Logo/.

The exact reviewed source revision, header digest, and build settings are
recorded in eng/webui-source-build-provenance.json. Each native package also
contains its source-build binary digests under provenance/WebUI. The C# ports
under samples/UpstreamExamples are derived from WebUI examples under its MIT
License.

The optional statically linked Windows build includes WebView2LoaderStatic.lib
from the Microsoft.Web.WebView2 SDK, version 1.0.4078.44. Its license and
third-party notices are included under licenses/WebView2 in the
CsWebUi.Native package.
